1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,922
Marinette, c'est vendredi treize aujourd'hui !
Marinette, it's Friday the 13th today!

2
00:00:04,222 --> 00:00:07,486
Oh non, c'est un jour de malchance !
Oh no, it's a day of bad luck!

3
00:00:07,786 --> 00:00:13,258
Pas en France ! Pour beaucoup de gens, ça porte bonheur !
Not in France! For many people, it brings good luck!

4
00:00:13,558 --> 00:00:17,806
Vraiment ? J'ai de la chance alors ?
Really? So I'm lucky?

5
00:00:18,106 --> 00:00:22,618
Oui ! Certains jouent même au Loto ce jour-là.
Yes! Some even play the lottery that day.

6
00:00:22,918 --> 00:00:25,942
Alors, bonne chance à nous deux !
Then good luck to both of us!

7
00:00:26,242 --> 00:00:30,322
Bonne chance ! Et bon vendredi !
Good luck! And have a good Friday!

8
00:00:30,622 --> 00:00:34,198
Merci ! Toi aussi !
Thanks! You too!

